From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:44:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): show the model choice on the concentration page
 (PD-2026-10-10-P2AR-UNIFIED, pending approval)

Routes Destination.CONCENTRATION through UnifiedConcentrationScreen with the
unchanged ConcentrationScreen as the default Legacy PK content, removes the
separate experimental drawer entry, and registers the exact AppShell.kt hash.
check_protocol.py rejects any PK-relevant deviation whose authorized_by is
empty or PENDING, so this bundle fails CI until the owner records approval.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ThtAJibEauf4YaLWkSEnRK
